orary-files"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied with direct metadata, checksum, and access-behavior evidence. The mandatory node-restart protocol is also complete: a healthy pre-restart state and boot identity were captured, the restart was acknowledged, a different boot identity was observed and independently corroborated, and services, data, permissions, and access behavior recovered successfully.","limitations":["Direct behavioral access tests sampled config.json before restart and records.csv after restart rather than testing every file under each identity; complete metadata and ACL listings nevertheless cover all preserved entries.","No cluster state was applicable because the managed topology contains only the single standalone node."]}
